			"notes": "Changes:\nIMPORTANT:  If updating from a previous version, please delete the Simply Swords config files and allow them to regenerate.\n\n-Unique weapons added: Soulstealer & Soulkeeper\n-Tooltips squished for many weapons\n-Plague effect remade - now converts positive effects into negative effects\n-Omen instantkill threshold adjusted to be % of total HP instead of flat value (Tooltip adjusted to reflect)\n-Watcher effect radius reduced\n-Storm effect radius reduced\n-Soulrender damage weights adjusted\n-Greataxe & Greathammer attack speed slightly increased\n-Runic rarity changed to rare instead of epic\n-Several general bugfixes"
		},
